WesomeCloud

This version was heavily inspired by, copied from, and developed with reference
to the ownCloud Desktop Client: https://github.com/owncloud/client

Credit belongs to the ownCloud Desktop Client authors and contributors for the
upstream work. WesomeCloud adapts that work and its synchronization concepts to
a native Swift macOS application using Apple's File Provider framework.
WesomeCloud is an independent project, not an official ownCloud client.

